Third-party components

At present oonfeeWRT contains no third-party source. This file exists so that
any future inclusion is attributed here rather than discovered later.

Runtime dependencies (fetched, not vendored) are listed in go.mod. Notably
modernc.org/sqlite and its transitive dependencies, which are BSD-3-Clause.

Nothing in this repository is copied from OpenWrt, LuCI, or any vendor
firmware. Where the documentation quotes ACL fragments or ubus method names,
those are interface facts about the system being managed — the shape of an API
we call — not copied implementation.
